																		Thanks, Attribution, Homage and Other Matters
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609448911" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1467337693 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">01 Jul 2016 01:48</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2530859">
									

<p>As always, allow me to express thanks to the various parties who have looked through it like ARD, Steeltitan, C-Dives, LordStonefish etc.</p>
<p>Image attribution are as allows:</p>
<ul>
<li>Image 1 by Batholith of Wikimedia Commons (<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Awashima_Hotel_20120801.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Awashima_Hotel_20120801.jpg</a>) under Public Domain</li>
<li>Image 2 by Charlesjsharp of Wikimedia Commons (<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Male_Gal%C3%A1pagos_penguin.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Male_Gal%C3%A1pagos_penguin.jpg</a>) under CC BY-SA 3.0</li>
<li>Image 3 by Martin Swart of Wikimedia Commons/Flickr (<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jackass_Penguin_Colony.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jackass_Penguin_Colony.jpg</a>) under CC BY-SA 2.0</li>
</ul>
<p>This article features: SCP-2296 (Emperor Penguin Tube Mommas) by Buttfranklin</p>
<p>This article is also a semi-homage to the anime <em>Love Live Sunshine</em>, which will air the next day or so. This article is inspired by an off-hand line in the CD drama (some absurd claim about a penguin hiding in a hotel room), that I thought could be manifested as an SCP (with a lot of add-ons). I will elaborate more on the homage and references thrown into this semi-homage.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<table class="wiki-content-table">
<tr>
<td>SCP-2720</td>
<td>&quot;720&quot; can be read as July 20, which is one of the dates of one of the franchise's song album release.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Site-123</td>
<td>Based on a radio show by the anime's cast, called 1,2, Sunshine. In Japanese, &quot;sunshine&quot; is transliterated as &quot;sanshain&quot; and &quot;san&quot; is a homophone of &quot;3&quot;.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Awashima Hotel</td>
<td>One of the settings for Love Live Sunshine.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>GoI-3004</td>
<td>&quot;3004&quot; can be read as 30 April, which is the date where Love Live Sunshine was announced.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>AquaS</td>
<td>Based on &quot;Aqours&quot; (pronounced &quot;aqua&quot;), the cast of Love Live Sunshine.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7th October 2015</td>
<td>Date which Aqours' first album was released.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Mary O'Hara</td>
<td>An Anglicised version of &quot;Mari Ohara&quot;, a character of Love Live Sunshine.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Daiya Kurosawa</td>
<td>Based directly on the kana spelling of Dia Kurosawa, another character of Love Live Sunshine.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&quot;in another world where we are part of a girl's school at Shizuoka Prefecture instead.&quot;</td>
<td>A direct reference to Love Live Sunshine itself, which takes place at a girl's school in said prefecture.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&quot;was inaugurated on June 2010.&quot;</td>
<td>Beginning of the Love Live franchise</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Penguins in the hotel</td>
<td>Based on a CD drama for Love Live Sunshine, where Dia freaked out and suggests that a penguin could be behind a locked hotel room.</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>And&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The caller(s) is <em>the</em> Conservancy itself. While the so-called affinity is mainly a homage, it can be construed to an implication that components within Awashima Hotel and the building the Conservancy is based at might have been used to build a certain high school in another world.</p>
<p>The Conservancy is currently classified as an GoI, since the Foundation does not know what is its true nature. It's more likely to suspect someone deliberately using a defunct Foundation front than to think that a front is manifested as a sentience.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

