<blockquote>
<p>why isn't the S for Shizuoka? &quot;AquaS&quot; isn't particularly standard for Foundation naming schemes.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Originally, I went for an orthodox S.C.P. acronym for the front name. Then, I decided that it looks dumb for a front of a secret organisation to have a consistent acronym. No matter how much we can twist the argument, it is not conducive to secrecy.</p>
<p>But I still need something that can prime readers into thinking that it is a Foundation front. Hence the stylisation of a capital S where it typically does not belong. And &quot;AquaS&quot; is part of the homage elements of this article.</p>

