			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2531563">
									

<p>I just don't think it gels. The not-quite-but-still S.C.P.-initialed front org gets rid of the fun sometimes inherent in that trope (e.g., S&amp;C Plastics), but the change isn't enough to help me take it seriously.</p>
<p>The idea of an extradimensional anomalous penguin conservancy is&#8230; ok. It being set in a hotel is weird imagery. A former front org taking a different direction could be neat (if my suspension of disbelief was still up, which it isn't), and the idea of an org acting like a person is pretty cool.</p>
<p>The elements just never come together for me. It's got some weird imagery and awkward dialogue meandering around and occasionally dropping story elements rather than integrating or revealing them.</p>
<p>No vote.</p>

